{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5vExE01EF5M7ORLiSRw8Lg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:24.798681+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5vExE01EF5M7ORLiSRw8Lg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/QEXl7VsqmNfVdrg4lRKvlvp5EAhoNbV3ySk22OfGIzFIZwEaH1buibfXNHdAl64oncm8iaCro4L1mM68VicL6Wx6w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>2026届推荐免试</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>研究生意向征集通知</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>西南交通大学信息科学与技术学院</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/8JadWK1qdOTkkOU6pQ0YvhzHbZZoTKlWicujrXRj9ic6SlBEBz7ueINGTptPDns5luburYfZoPxQTkNeREXEEZicQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/8JadWK1qdOTkkOU6pQ0YvhzHbZZoTKlWjrJeGAWuJSkRxt2SkwCPGRSwricjChhnrxnyjl4o8wNIuLFY8Cibwb3Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>  西南交通大学信息科学与技术学院热忱欢迎全国各地优秀大学生通过推荐免试方式攻读我院硕士研究生和直博生。为做好2026届推荐免试研究生工作，我院将于2025年9月11日至9月18日期间进行推免生意向征集工作，现将具体事项通知如下：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/8JadWK1qdOTkkOU6pQ0YvhzHbZZoTKlWicujrXRj9ic6SlBEBz7ueINGTptPDns5luburYfZoPxQTkNeREXEEZicQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>拟接收推免生专业目录如下：</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/LwnJ7Kibr2u1oFHLBibctWJfdfHIY5BtSsqO28UgNXSIYPdtOxLYSBngDvfbOky0qxpndJmYUDDkYVKBtrZXIuBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/ZREFZVCUS3CD1pu8RUP9fDzErVajZXHZ5zpvHI9jW7pNSyic3UxribxeBicCddBMHibhnp9JJgPLOfvBTQzxY8opWg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/QEXl7VsqmNdKAWAECPkw7qpG3u55wFQX9tED9XpCpYdz0Df61eRTBvugG135VSN74zfWxfsd0KYJQopGhSkxxg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/LwnJ7Kibr2u1oFHLBibctWJfdfHIY5BtSsCbqUsXzhOdl6LpfSYwqiaiaj8vj6dh8VY5QoaAbbn2t0aiabnc5nZy8yg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/8JadWK1qdOTkkOU6pQ0YvhzHbZZoTKlWicujrXRj9ic6SlBEBz7ueINGTptPDns5luburYfZoPxQTkNeREXEEZicQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>征集范围</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/LwnJ7Kibr2u1oFHLBibctWJfdfHIY5BtSsqO28UgNXSIYPdtOxLYSBngDvfbOky0qxpndJmYUDDkYVKBtrZXIuBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>已获得本科所在学校推荐免试资格，且有意申请我院推荐免试研究生的应届本科毕业生均可参加本次意向征集。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/8JadWK1qdOTkkOU6pQ0YvhzHbZZoTKlWicujrXRj9ic6SlBEBz7ueINGTptPDns5luburYfZoPxQTkNeREXEEZicQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>征集流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/LwnJ7Kibr2u1oFHLBibctWJfdfHIY5BtSsqO28UgNXSIYPdtOxLYSBngDvfbOky0qxpndJmYUDDkYVKBtrZXIuBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1、申请加入“信息学院2026届推免意向征集通知群”，</span><span><strong><span>群QQ号为：584445645</span></strong></span><span>，</span><span><span>进群需要用“姓名+本科学校名称”进行验证。</span></span><span>此群仅作通知使用。</span></p><p><span>2、扫描下方二维码进行报名申请，</span><span><strong><span>报名截止时间为2025年9月18日20:00。</span></strong></span><span>报名时将个人证明材料合并为1个PDF文件上传，请使用电脑填报，并在填报前准备齐全相关材料，</span><span><strong><span>一次性填报正确，无需重复报名或多次填写。</span></strong></span><span>学院将对参与意向征集的同学所提供的信息进行审核，请正确填写个人信息及联系方式，</span><strong><span><span>保持联络方式畅通，</span></span></strong><span>便于学院联系，详细安排见后续通知。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/QEXl7VsqmNdKAWAECPkw7qpG3u55wFQXV4vibR6SZMYRNZIfvqRWqIlkoS83tiaBWzXEIoSsnUDnr8OJxnSVL4Zg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>网址填写链接：</span><strong><span><span>https://send2me.cn/p-KXt91I/SuO2MitTyN9YjQ</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>请考生将以下</span><span><strong><span>个人证明材料按照先后顺序合并在1个总PDF中上传（文件大小不要超过10M），</span></strong></span><span>将PDF命名为：姓名-学校-手机号码-推免证明材料</span></p><p><span>（1）个人身份证扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（2）个人学生证扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（3）本科阶段成绩单；</span></p><p><span>（4）本科阶段成绩排名证明（证明应加盖院系或学校相关部门的公章后扫描）；</span></p><p><span>（5）外语水平证明扫描件（如四六级证书等）；</span></p><p><span>（6）个人简历及科研获奖等证书扫描件。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/8JadWK1qdOTkkOU6pQ0YvhzHbZZoTKlWicujrXRj9ic6SlBEBz7ueINGTptPDns5luburYfZoPxQTkNeREXEEZicQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>温馨提醒</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/LwnJ7Kibr2u1oFHLBibctWJfdfHIY5BtSsqO28UgNXSIYPdtOxLYSBngDvfbOky0qxpndJmYUDDkYVKBtrZXIuBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>推荐免试研究生报名及录取工作均须在教育部规定时间内通过教育部“全国推荐优秀应届本科生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（简称推免服务系统，网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/ ）完成。凡被我校接收的同学，由学校通过“推免服务系统”发布待录取通知，学生收到待录取通知后，须在规定时间内通过“推免服务系统”确认拟录取，否则视为放弃。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/8JadWK1qdOTkkOU6pQ0YvhzHbZZoTKlWicujrXRj9ic6SlBEBz7ueINGTptPDns5luburYfZoPxQTkNeREXEEZicQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>PART.05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/LwnJ7Kibr2u1oFHLBibctWJfdfHIY5BtSsqO28UgNXSIYPdtOxLYSBngDvfbOky0qxpndJmYUDDkYVKBtrZXIuBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>信息学院研究生教务：刘老师、周老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：028-66367461</span></p><p><span>邮箱：jsjjw@swjtu.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/LwnJ7Kibr2u1oFHLBibctWJfdfHIY5BtSsqO28UgNXSIYPdtOxLYSBngDvfbOky0qxpndJmYUDDkYVKBtrZXIuBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span>图文来源｜</span></strong></span><span><span>信息科学与技术学院</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>本期编辑｜</span></strong></span><span><span>张馨月</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>一审一校｜</span></strong></span><span><span>袁千寒</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>二审二校｜</span></strong></span><span><span>张馨月</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三审三校｜</span></span></strong><span><span>傅尤刚</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/QEXl7VsqmNfVdrg4lRKvlvp5EAhoNbV3BcTQZV5v6Rb9iagfcZSUQbjSKz5ktvJpMUib8aCuuEbEDzt3CSDnK1IQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>西南交通大学信息科学与技术学院in传媒inmedia@home.swjtu.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a1bfb89dca70b9394103bf25c67f08bfbfad68776b0c